pal-request-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the caller to request.user as currentUser.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1848,"endLine":1849}]},{"id":"resource-document","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler loads the target Document identified by pk and includes its owner relation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1850,"endLine":1855}]},{"id":"document-view-control","kind":"control","statement":"Before method-specific processing, the handler denies access when the owner-aware view_document check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1857,"endLine":1862}]},{"id":"post-change-control","kind":"control","statement":"On POST, the handler denies note creation when the owner-aware change_document check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1877,"endLine":1886}]},{"id":"owner-aware-helper","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware helper permits when the object has no owner, the owner equals the user, or the object permission checker grants the requested permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9568837fbfe275f5","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"note-create-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the POST change authorization check, the handler creates the Note for the document, note payload, and current user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1888,"endLine":1892}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]},{"obligationId":"scenario%3Aview-only::entry%3Anotes-post","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"deny"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared notes POST entry, the handler binds the caller from request.user and loads the target document. The document-view check passes under the stated object view grant. On the POST path, however, the handler separately requires the owner-aware change_document check. The premise states that the caller is not the owner and has no object change_document grant; under the supplied helper behavior, neither the ownership alternative nor the object-permission alternative is satisfied. The handler returns HTTP 403 before Note.objects.create, so the observed source behavior is deny. This matches the accepted policy expectation: a view grant and the stated global permissions do not substitute for object-level change authorization.","facts":[{"id":"entry-notes-post","kind":"entry","statement":"The requested authorization path is the notes handler, with POST handling selected by request.method.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1841,"endLine":1848},{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1868,"endLine":1877}]},{"id":"principal-request-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the caller to request.user as currentUser.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1848,"endLine":1849}]},{"id":"resource-document","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler loads the target Document identified by pk and includes its owner relation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1850,"endLine":1855}]},{"id":"document-view-control","kind":"control","statement":"Before method-specific processing, the handler denies access when the owner-aware view_document check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1857,"endLine":1862}]},{"id":"post-change-control","kind":"control","statement":"On POST, the handler denies note creation when the owner-aware change_document check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1877,"endLine":1886}]},{"id":"owner-aware-helper","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware helper permits when the object has no owner, the owner equals the user, or the object permission checker grants the requested permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9568837fbfe275f5","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"note-create-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The Note.obje